| 9 or above | Definite |
| 5–8 | Probable |
| 1–4 | Possible |
| 0 | Doubtful |

**Final Causality Assessment: POSSIBLE**

The score is 3 based on the information available in the case scenario. The relationship is supported by the timing of the reaction and improvement following discontinuation, although other causes have not been adequately evaluated.

